          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The formula for the volume <span class=\"math\">[MATH: V]</span> of a cube with sides of length <span class=\"math\">[MATH: s]</span> is given by</p>",
            "readable_text": "The formula for the volume [MATH: V] of a cube with sides of length [MATH: s] is given by",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: V = s^3.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: V = s^3.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To find the volume of this cube, we substitute <span class=\"math\">[MATH: s=2 \\: \\textrm{cm}]</span> into the formula. This gives</p>",
            "readable_text": "To find the volume of this cube, we substitute [MATH: s=2 \\: \\textrm{cm}] into the formula. This gives",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: V = (2\\, \\textrm{cm})^3 = 8 \\text{ cm}^3 .]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: V = (2\\, \\textrm{cm})^3 = 8 \\text{ cm}^3 .]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>So the volume of the cube is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8\\,\\textrm{cm}^3.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "So the volume of the cube is [MATH: 8\\,\\textrm{cm}^3.]",
