        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nSuppose that we have a cube whose edges are [MATH: 2\\,\\textrm{cm}] in length, like the one shown below.\n\nGraphic:\n[IMG: /graphics/d04832ca9d8be3328d8c1b27f8076fa5]\n\nContent:\nThe formula for the volume [MATH: V] of a cube with sides of length [MATH: s] is given by\n\nContent:\n[MATH: V = s^3.]\n\nContent:\nTo find the volume of this cube, we substitute [MATH: s=2 \\: \\textrm{cm}] into the formula. This gives\n\nContent:\n[MATH: V = (2\\, \\textrm{cm})^3 = 8 \\text{ cm}^3 .]\n\nContent:\nSo the volume of the cube is [MATH: 8\\,\\textrm{cm}^3.]"
      },
