        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The volume of a cube is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 729\\, \\textrm{cm}^3.]</span> Find the length of the edges of the cube.</p>",
            "readable_text": "The volume of a cube is [MATH: 729\\, \\textrm{cm}^3.] Find the length of the edges of the cube.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Since the volume of a cube is </p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: V = s^3,]</span></p><p>where <span class=\"math\">[MATH: s]</span> is the length of an edge, we can find <span class=\"math\">[MATH: s]</span> as follows:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: s = \\sqrt[3]{V} =  \\sqrt[3]{729} = 9]</span></p><p>Therefore, the length of the edges is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 9\\,\\textrm{cm}.]</span> </p>",
            "readable_text": "Since the volume of a cube is\n\n[MATH: V = s^3,]\n\nwhere [MATH: s] is the length of an edge, we can find [MATH: s] as follows:\n\n[MATH: s = \\sqrt[3]{V} = \\sqrt[3]{729} = 9]\n\nTherefore, the length of the edges is [MATH: 9\\,\\textrm{cm}.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nThe volume of a cube is [MATH: 729\\, \\textrm{cm}^3.] Find the length of the edges of the cube.\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nSince the volume of a cube is\n\n[MATH: V = s^3,]\n\nwhere [MATH: s] is the length of an edge, we can find [MATH: s] as follows:\n\n[MATH: s = \\sqrt[3]{V} = \\sqrt[3]{729} = 9]\n\nTherefore, the length of the edges is [MATH: 9\\,\\textrm{cm}.]"
      },
