        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nEach side of an ice cube has length [MATH: (1)/(2)in.] What is the volume of the ice cube?\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: (1)/(8)in^{3}]\nb. [MATH: 8in^{3}]\nc. [MATH: (1)/(4)in^{3}]\nd. [MATH: (3)/(2)in^{3}]\ne. [MATH: 2in^{3}]"
      }
